  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of the determinant of matrix <math><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></math> is (where <math><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mi>B</mi></math> are square matrices of order <math><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></math> )",
